  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1a2b3c4d5e6f708192a3b4c5d6e7f801, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tuning_Grippy
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  profileName: Grippy
  whyThisSetup: 'REJECTED as the default. Grip 18 with a matching tighter steering
    curve, stronger brakes and a snappier turn-in. Very precise and very forgiving,
    but the car basically does not slide, so the handbrake has nothing to do and cornering
    has no texture at all. New players do well straight away and then stop improving,
    because there is no limit left for them to learn. Top speed and physics rate are
    identical to Balanced on purpose, so the two can be compared on the same test.
    Worth keeping for a tutorial delivery or a slow zone where we do not want the
    player fighting the car.'
